{"setting":"beach","title":"Contact · First contact","description":"The complete supplied beach scene, with two physical voices, original music and a remembered shoreline.","duration":299.19081632653064,"audio":"mix.mp3","characters":[{"id":"ellie","name":"Ellie Arroway","role":"The visitor · CHIMERA physical voice","tele":"ellie.tele","telemetryEncoding":"gzip"},{"id":"father","name":"Father","role":"A familiar form · CHIMERA physical voice","tele":"father.tele","telemetryEncoding":"gzip"}],"cues":[{"start":109.73965,"end":110.6,"speaker":"father","text":"Hi, Sparks.","intensity":0.55},{"start":112.83914,"end":113.4245,"speaker":"ellie","text":"Dad?","intensity":0.55},{"start":122.05933,"end":123.06,"speaker":"father","text":"I missed you.","intensity":0.55},{"start":129.5589,"end":130.59780999999998,"speaker":"ellie","text":"I missed you.","intensity":0.55},{"start":130.71781,"end":133.282659196,"speaker":"father","text":"Oh, I'm sorry I couldn't be there for you, sweetheart.","intensity":0.55},{"start":143.77662,"end":144.81315,"speaker":"ellie","text":"You're not real.","intensity":0.55},{"start":147.08231,"end":148.28783084,"speaker":"ellie","text":"None of this is real.","intensity":0.55},{"start":148.63851,"end":149.86284,"speaker":"father","text":"That's my scientist.","intensity":0.55},{"start":151.87679,"end":156.5294872832,"speaker":"ellie","text":"When I was unconscious, you downloaded my thoughts, my memories even.","intensity":0.55},{"start":161.74828,"end":163.878275764,"speaker":"father","text":"We thought this might make things easier for you.","intensity":0.55},{"start":178.18656,"end":179.63,"speaker":"ellie","text":"Why did you contact us?","intensity":0.55},{"start":179.68895,"end":180.93,"speaker":"father","text":"You contacted us.","intensity":0.55},{"start":182.03268,"end":183.0775627896,"speaker":"father","text":"We were just listening.","intensity":0.55},{"start":184.70803,"end":185.774788,"speaker":"ellie","text":"And there are others?","intensity":0.55},{"start":185.95152,"end":186.67,"speaker":"father","text":"Many others.","intensity":0.55},{"start":192.41613,"end":197.57,"speaker":"ellie","text":"They all travel here through that transit system that you built.","intensity":0.55},{"start":197.75845,"end":199.14,"speaker":"father","text":"We didn't build it.","intensity":0.55},{"start":200.43912,"end":201.5370831,"speaker":"father","text":"We don't know who did.","intensity":0.55},{"start":204.06746,"end":206.3288747192,"speaker":"father","text":"No, they were gone long before we ever got here.","intensity":0.55},{"start":207.60843,"end":208.982145564,"speaker":"father","text":"Maybe someday they'll come back.","intensity":0.55},{"start":210.4676,"end":213.08966,"speaker":"ellie","text":"All the other civilizations that you find, they come here?","intensity":0.55},{"start":213.20966,"end":213.8112662,"speaker":"father","text":"Not all.","intensity":0.55},{"start":216.20891,"end":217.36867,"speaker":"ellie","text":"Is this some test?","intensity":0.55},{"start":217.48867,"end":218.61281,"speaker":"father","text":"No. No tests.","intensity":0.55},{"start":222.27836,"end":223.676882372,"speaker":"father","text":"You have your mother's hands.","intensity":0.55},{"start":233.97765,"end":235.58,"speaker":"father","text":"You're an interesting species,","intensity":0.55},{"start":236.94242,"end":238.02,"speaker":"father","text":"an interesting mix.","intensity":0.55},{"start":239.75633,"end":242.18,"speaker":"father","text":"You're capable of such beautiful dreams,","intensity":0.55},{"start":243.62218,"end":245.00418,"speaker":"father","text":"and such horrible nightmares.","intensity":0.55},{"start":247.20683,"end":248.41,"speaker":"father","text":"You feel so lost,","intensity":0.55},{"start":249.73232,"end":250.67,"speaker":"father","text":"so cut off,","intensity":0.55},{"start":251.13537,"end":252.11,"speaker":"father","text":"so alone,","intensity":0.55},{"start":254.12186,"end":255.04,"speaker":"father","text":"only you're not.","intensity":0.55},{"start":257.97606,"end":258.56,"speaker":"father","text":"See,","intensity":0.55},{"start":259.93865,"end":260.92,"speaker":"father","text":"in all our searching,","intensity":0.55},{"start":261.80111,"end":264.3545189126,"speaker":"father","text":"the only thing we've found that makes the emptiness bearable","intensity":0.55},{"start":265.4397,"end":266.16,"speaker":"father","text":"is each other.","intensity":0.55},{"start":270.78888,"end":271.992082296,"speaker":"ellie","text":"What happens now?","intensity":0.55},{"start":273.72697,"end":274.09,"speaker":"father","text":"Now,","intensity":0.55},{"start":276.19181,"end":277.29,"speaker":"father","text":"you go home.","intensity":0.55},{"start":278.12946,"end":278.705081,"speaker":"ellie","text":"Home?","intensity":0.55},{"start":281.34891,"end":283.04861999999997,"speaker":"ellie","text":"But... I have so many questions.","intensity":0.55},{"start":283.16862,"end":284.514552,"speaker":"ellie","text":"Do we get to come back?","intensity":0.55},{"start":285.9891,"end":287.4101391,"speaker":"father","text":"This was just the first step.","intensity":0.55},{"start":288.42842,"end":289.6272558356,"speaker":"father","text":"In time, you'll take another.","intensity":0.55},{"start":291.70645,"end":294.27,"speaker":"ellie","text":"But other people need to see what I've seen. They need to see...","intensity":0.55},{"start":294.31072,"end":296.524592596,"speaker":"father","text":"This is the way it's been done for billions of years.","intensity":0.55}],"shots":[{"time":0,"view":"ellie"},{"time":12.7127,"view":"contact-sky"},{"time":15.9159,"view":"ellie"},{"time":21.488133,"view":"contact-sky"},{"time":28.2282,"view":"ellie"},{"time":63.630233,"view":"wide"},{"time":66.9669,"view":"ellie"},{"time":79.712967,"view":"wide"},{"time":89.055633,"view":"ellie"},{"time":92.8928,"view":"wide"},{"time":110.844067,"view":"ellie"},{"time":121.354567,"view":"father"},{"time":123.6235,"view":"ellie"},{"time":159.325833,"view":"father"},{"time":174.040533,"view":"contact-hands"},{"time":183.3832,"view":"ellie"},{"time":185.552033,"view":"father"},{"time":187.921067,"view":"contact-hands"},{"time":191.824967,"view":"ellie"},{"time":196.9968,"view":"father"},{"time":214.180633,"view":"ellie"},{"time":219.5193,"view":"father"},{"time":223.6234,"view":"ellie"},{"time":225.892333,"view":"contact-hands"},{"time":267.233633,"view":"ellie"},{"time":272.739133,"view":"wide"},{"time":282.5823,"view":"ellie"},{"time":285.018067,"view":"father"},{"time":289.922967,"view":"ellie"},{"time":294.827867,"view":"father"},{"time":297.630667,"view":"ellie"}]}